#: src/email.cpp:539
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains more than one "
"@. You will not create valid messages if you do not change your address."
msgstr ""
"De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt mehr as een »@«-Teken. Mit disse "
"Adress laat sik keen Nettbreven opstellen, änner ehr bitte."

#: src/email.cpp:544
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not contain a @. "
"You will not create valid messages if you do not change your address."
msgstr ""
"De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt keen »@«-Teken. Mit disse Adress "
"laat sik keen Nettbreven opstellen, änner ehr bitte."

#: src/email.cpp:549
msgid "You have to enter something in the email address field."
msgstr "Du muttst wat na't Nettpostadress-Feld ingeven."

#: src/email.cpp:551
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not contain a "
"local part."
msgstr "De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt keen Lokaaldeel."

#: src/email.cpp:554
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not contain a "
"domain part."
msgstr "De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt keen Domään."

#: src/email.cpp:557
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains unclosed "
"comments/brackets."
msgstr ""
"De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt nich afslaten Kommentaren oder "
"Klemmen."

#: src/email.cpp:560
msgid "The email address you entered is valid."
msgstr "De ingeven Nettpostadress gellt."

#: src/email.cpp:562
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains an unclosed "
"angle bracket."
msgstr ""
"De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt en nich slaten Spitzklemm "
"(\"Lütter as\"-Teken)."

#: src/email.cpp:565
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains too many "
"closing angle brackets."
msgstr ""
"De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt to vele tomaakt Spitzklemmen "
"(\"Grötter as\"-Teken)."

#: src/email.cpp:568
msgid ""
"The email address you have entered is not valid because it contains an "
"unexpected comma."
msgstr "De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt en nich verwacht Komma."

#: src/email.cpp:571
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it ended unexpectedly. "
"This probably means you have used an escaping type character like a '\\' as "
"the last character in your email address."
msgstr ""
"De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se endt bi en nich verwacht Steed. "
"Wohrschienlich hest Du en Schuulteken as »\\« as dat leste Teken vun Dien "
"Nettpostadress ingeven."

#: src/email.cpp:576
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains quoted text "
"which does not end."
msgstr ""
"De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt Text in Goosfööt, de nich endt."

#: src/email.cpp:579 src/email.cpp:658
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not seem to "
"contain an actual email address, i.e. something of the form joe@example.org."
msgstr ""
"De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, as't lett bargt se gor keen "
"Nettpostadress (jichtenswat vun de Form »klaas@bispill.net«)"

#: src/email.cpp:583
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains an illegal "
"character."
msgstr "De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt en nich tolaten Bookstaav."

#: src/email.cpp:586
msgid ""
"The email address you have entered is not valid because it contains an "
"invalid display name."
msgstr "De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt en nich tolaten Wiesnaam."

#: src/email.cpp:589
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not contain a '."
"'. You will not create valid messages if you do not change your address."
msgstr ""
"De ingeven Nettpostadress is leeg, se bargt keen » . «. Mit disse Adress "
"laat sik keen Nettbreven opstellen, änner ehr bitte."

#: src/email.cpp:595
msgid "Unknown problem with email address"
msgstr "Nich begäng Problem mit de Nettpostadress"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:46
msgid "File I/O Error"
msgstr "Datei-In-/Utgaavfehler"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:66
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The specified file does not exist:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Dat gifft de angeven Datei nich:\n"
"%1"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:72
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This is a folder and not a file:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Dit is en Orner, keen Datei:\n"
"%1"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:78
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You do not have read permissions to the file:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Du hest keen Leesverlöven för de Datei:\n"
"%1"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:90
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Could not read file:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Datei lett sik nich lesen:\n"
"%1"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:93
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Could not open file:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Datei lett sik nich opmaken:\n"
"%1"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:96
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Error while reading file:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Fehler bi't Lesen vun de Datei:\n"
"%1"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:114
#, kde-format
msgid "Could only read 1 byte of %2."
msgid_plural "Could only read %1 bytes of %2."
msgstr[0] "Bloots 1 Byte vun %2 leet sik lesen."
msgstr[1] "Bloots %1 Bytes vun %2 leten sik lesen."

#: src/kfileio.cpp:139
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"File %1 exists.\n"
"Do you want to replace it?"
msgstr ""
"Dat gifft de Datei \"%1\" al.\n"
"Wullt Du ehr överschrieven?"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:141 src/kfileio.cpp:162
msgid "Save to File"
msgstr "As Datei sekern"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:142
msgid "&Replace"
msgstr "Ö&verschrieven"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:161
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Failed to make a backup copy of %1.\n"
"Continue anyway?"
msgstr ""
"Fehler bi't Opstellen vun en Sekerheitskopie för %1.\n"
"Liekers wiedermaken?"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:175 src/kfileio.cpp:191
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Could not write to file:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Datei lett sik nich schrieven:\n"
"%1"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:178
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Could not open file for writing:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Datei lett sik nich för't Schrieven opmaken:\n"
"%1"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:181
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Error while writing file:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Fehler bi't Schrieven vun Datei:\n"
"%1"

#: src/kfileio.cpp:195
#, kde-format
msgid "Could only write 1 byte of %2."
msgid_plural "Could only write %1 bytes of %2."
msgstr[0] "Bloots 1 Byte vun %2 leet sik schrieven."
msgstr[1] "Bloots %1 Bytes vun %2 leten sik schrieven."

#: src/kfileio.cpp:222
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 does not exist"
msgstr "\"%1\" gifft dat nich."

#: src/kfileio.cpp:233
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 is not accessible and that is unchangeable."
msgstr "Keen Togriep op \"%1\", dat lett sik ok nich ännern."

#: src/kfileio.cpp:254
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 is not readable and that is unchangeable."
msgstr "\"%1\" lett sik nich lesen, dat lett sik ok nich ännern."

#: src/kfileio.cpp:270
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 is not writable and that is unchangeable."
msgstr "\"%1\" lett sik nich schrieven, dat lett sik ok nich ännern."

#: src/kfileio.cpp:284
#, kde-format
msgid "Folder %1 is inaccessible."
msgstr "Keen Togriep op Orner \"%1\"."
